  "body": "Headings are a way that many blind people navigate content. We don't want for  Developers are often forced to decide between a ```<legend>``` or a heading... inside a Fieldset\r\n\r\nOn the W3C side HTML 5.2 allows for Phrasing content and headings to be included.\r\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/html52/sec-forms.html#the-legend-element\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2365411/68939022-99b7a300-076d-11ea-97d4-fb7288b302df.png)\r\n\r\nWHATWG version\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2365411/68939171-ef8c4b00-076d-11ea-92c4-c0b6e3fecb83.png)\r\n\r\nHeadings inside ```<legend>``` have have been tested with browsers and screen readers and work well.\r\n\r\nSuggest update to content model to include\r\n\r\n**CURRENT WHATWG**\r\nContent model:\r\nPhrasing content \r\n\r\n**SUGGESTED AS per HTML 5.2**\r\nContent model:\r\nPhrasing content and headings (h1-h6 elements).",
